## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html

## Resolve remote nodes through SSH tunnels set up by
## Voyager.Services.RemoteNodeConnector. Must be set at VM boot so net_kernel
## picks it up when distribution starts at runtime. Mirrors dev/server.sh.
-proto_dist inet6_tcp -epmd_module Elixir.Voyager.ProxyEpmd
